        {
          "_name": "tabs01",
          "_sourceTheme": "termm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"tabs01 termm5\" group=\"List\" plugins=\"mbr-tabs\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <header>Tabs</header>\n        <select title=\"Count\" name=\"bootstrapTabs\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Tabs Color\" value=\"#000000\" name=\"tabs\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Tabs BG\" value=\"#a0e1e1\" name=\"tabsBg\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Image Border\" value=\"#000000\" name=\"border\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/termm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/termm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#f1f1f1\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-10\">\n                <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .tabs-wrap\">\n                        What I <b><i>bring</i></b> to the <b><i>table</i></b></h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tabs-wrap\">\n                    <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item first mbr-fonts-style\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\"><a class=\"nav-link show active\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tabs01-6_tab0\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Web Design</a></li>\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 1\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\"><a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style active\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tabs01-6_tab1\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">Web Development</a></li>\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 2\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\"><a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style active\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tabs01-6_tab2\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">SEO</a></li>\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 3\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\"><a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style active\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tabs01-6_tab3\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">Soft Skills</a></li>\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\"><a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style active\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tabs01-6_tab4\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n                                Tenancy in common\n                            </a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                    <div id=\"tab1\" class=\"tab-pane in active\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                            <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/download.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                                    .&nbsp;Custom WordPress website creation<br>.&nbsp;SEO-friendly design practices<br>.&nbsp;Advanced Elementor design &amp; customization<br>.&nbsp;Design consistency &amp; aesthetics<br>.&nbsp;Fully responsive &amp; mobile friendly layouts<br>.&nbsp;Call-to-action (CTA) optimization<br>.&nbsp;HTML5 &amp; CSS3 for pixel-perfect designs<br>.&nbsp;Design consistency &amp; aesthetics<br>.&nbsp;CSS animations &amp; transitions for interactive UI<br>.&nbsp;Landing page &amp; conversion optimization</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"tab2\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 1\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                            <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/programmer-coding-gif.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                                    .&nbsp;HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6+)<br>.&nbsp;Secure coding practices &amp; SSL implementation<br>.&nbsp;Responsive &amp; mobile-first web development<br>.&nbsp;Website backups &amp; maintenance<br>.&nbsp;CSS frameworks (Tailwind, Bootstrap)<br>.&nbsp;Server &amp; hosting setup (cPanel, Cloudflare)<br>.&nbsp;Cross-browser compatibility &amp; performance optimization<br>.&nbsp;JavaScript libraries (GSAP, ScrollMagic)<br>.&nbsp;Interactive UI/UX with animations &amp; transitions<br>.&nbsp;API integration &amp; data handling</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"tab3\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 2\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                            <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/consulting-digital-marketing-gif-by-voxel.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                                    .&nbsp;Website speed optimization<br>.&nbsp;Meta tags (title, description, headers)<br>.&nbsp;Mobile-first design &amp; optimization<br>.&nbsp;XML sitemaps &amp; robots.txt management<br>.&nbsp;Keyword research &amp; optimization<br>.&nbsp;Google Analytics &amp; Search Console<br>.&nbsp;Rank tracking &amp; competitor analysis<br>.&nbsp;Local SEO (Google My Business, citations)</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"tab4\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 3\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                            <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/jimmy-fallon-skills-gif-by-the-tonight-show-starring-jimmy-fallon.gif\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                                    .&nbsp;Ability to lead projects and work seamlessly with&nbsp; designers, developers and clients<br>.&nbsp;Strong ability to understand client needs and translate&nbsp; &nbsp; them into effective web solutions<br>.&nbsp;Quick adaptability to troubleshoot  issues and provide innovative solutions<br>.&nbsp;Efficiently manage tight deadlines and high-demand projects without compromising quality<br>.&nbsp;Clear and professional communication with clients and team members<br>.&nbsp;Staying updated with the latest web technologies, trends, and best practices<br><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"tab5\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 4\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                            <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                                <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/termm5/components/_images/term/image11.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                                    Tenancy in common is another form of co-ownership, but unlike joint tenancy, there\n                                    is no right of survivorship. Each co-owner can have a different ownership interest,\n                                    and they can freely transfer or sell their share without the consent of the other\n                                    co-owners. A trust estate refers to property or assets held in a trust for the\n                                    benefit of specific individuals or entities, known as beneficiaries. The trustee\n                                    manages and administers the trust according to its terms.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
